--- Third-party data and trade marks ---

This project consumes data from the Fantasy Premier League public API
(fantasy.premierleague.com), which is undocumented and unofficial, and from
Football-Data.co.uk. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or associated with
the Premier League, Fantasy Premier League, the Football Association Premier
League Limited, or any football club. "Premier League" and "Fantasy Premier
League" are trade marks of the Football Association Premier League Limited and
are used here only for factual identification. No official kits, badges or
crests are reproduced; club colours are applied to generic shirt shapes.

Third-party dependencies remain under their own licences.
